# =============================================================================
# .gitignore
#
# The repository holds code only. Everything read from the restricted HILDA
# release, and everything the pipeline writes, stays out of version control.
# A fresh clone rebuilds all of it: the synthetic panel from a fixed seed by
# 00b_make_synthetic_hilda.R, and the tables, figures and logs by run_all.R.
# =============================================================================

# ── Data: restricted (real) and generated (synthetic) panels ─────────────────
*.rds
*.dta
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
fte_experience/

# ── Pipeline outputs, registries and logs ────────────────────────────────────
*.csv
*.log
output/
run_logs/
handoff/
figures/
training_designs/
BLIND_training_estimates.rds

# ── R session files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
*.RData

# ── Editor and OS files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
